step Yetis at Feral Scar Vale
  zone Feralas
  tip Feral Scar Yetis, Enraged Feral Scars and Hulking Feral Scars, level 43 to 46, pack the yeti cave at Feral Scar Vale in south Feralas. Horde come from Camp Mojache, Alliance from Feathermoon Stronghold.
