# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Skinning 280-300

section Skinning 280-300

step Dinosaurs in western Un'Goro Crater
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Fly to Marshal's Refuge, then work the dinosaurs in western Un'Goro Crater: Diemetradons, Elder Diemetradons and Frenzied Pterrordaxes, level 50 to 55. The plain Pterrordaxes roost at the crater's south edge, so the loop dips down to them.
